From 496ebb46f391c934d66f465bbfc25d9d5c28e454 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris Manjaya <chrismanjaya@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 16:52:52 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add Frankie persona: pooled error replies and transaction
 quips

- Error replies are picked at random from Frankie's pools (EN/ID), never
  repeating the last variant a user saw, with a time-of-day greeting. The
  error code is still appended for debugging.
- New transaction confirmations get a short in-character quip 35% of the
  time, written by Gemini in the same Parse request, with pooled fallbacks.
- New internal/persona package; pools live in internal/message/pools.go.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01U4XsZULyGL5Ja6PMPZrTHh
